# Customer Segmentation Analysis

## Project Overview
This project focuses on analyzing customer data and grouping customers into different segments based on their characteristics and purchasing behavior.

## Dataset
Customer dataset is used to understand customer patterns and identify different customer groups.

## Tools Used
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- Scikit-learn

## Steps Performed
- Data loading
- Data cleaning
- Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
- Feature analysis
- Customer segmentation using clustering techniques
- Data visualization

## Conclusion
This analysis helps businesses understand customer groups and make better decisions for marketing strategies.
